]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for McPherson County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that pair hit 30% of normal, while May to June and June to July both ran 149% of normal. So far in 2026, February to March and March to April each sit at 31% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
